{"quest_id": 4447, "name": "聖夜の弓騎兵", "description": "王子達に突然襲い掛かってきた\nトナカイに跨る赤い服を着た者とは……。\n\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "暗黒騎士団と聖夜の贈り物", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920057, "map_no": 3147, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 15, "exp": 140, "gold": 500, "drops": [{"card": 317, "c": 1}, {"card": 55, "c": 1}, {"item": 1001, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 31, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 24}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 56}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 150, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 260, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 162, "move_speed": 1400.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2103808, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 338, "global_id": 337, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 98}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、ごぞんじですか。冬の季節になると、\n子供たちが寝ている間にプレゼントを\n配っている方がいらっしゃったそうです。"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "フフフ、嘘か真かわかりませんが\n良い子にしていないとプレゼントがもらえないと\nいたずらするたびに親に脅されたものです。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "私は信じていましたよ。魔物が復活した今でも、\n子供たちに夢と希望を届けていてくれたらと\n願わずにはいられません。"}, {"name": "兵士", "text": "報告！　前方から魔物が出現！", "face": "lf74ec7ef8c83"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子！　魔物が現れたようです！\n戦闘のご準備を！", "face": "lbbf1ee25fd02"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "ねぇ、あなたが魔物と戦っている\n王子さま？", "face": "u317"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "誰ですかあなたは！？\nその恰好は……！", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "あたしのプレゼントを待っている\nたくさんの子供たちのために……", "face": "u317"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "お命頂戴いたします！", "face": "u317"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "プレゼントを待っている子供たちって……\nいったい何を言っているんですか？", "face": "lbbf1ee25fd02"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "悪いけど悠長に話している時間が\nないのよね～。\nさっそく行かせてもらうわ♪", "face": "u317"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "えっ！？　ちょっと待ってください！", "face": "lbbf1ee25fd02"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "さすがに強いわね。\nあたしも少しは腕に自信があったのに\nお姉さん、ちょっとショック……。", "face": "u317"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "どうして私たちを襲うのですか？\n理由を……。", "face": "l2fa9ce301d9e"}, {"name": "暗黒騎士デシウス", "text": "サラサよ、はやく撤退するぞ。", "face": "l3211f683040c"}, {"name": "サラサ", "text": "次はもう少し作戦を練ってくるわね。\nじゃあ、またね～♪", "face": "u317"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……行ってしまいました。\n時間がないといっていましたが、\nなにか急いでいるのでしょうか？", "face": "l2fa9ce301d9e"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "その事で、彼女から伝言を預かって\nきています。", "face": "u316"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "あなたは……。", "face": "lbbf1ee25fd02"}, {"name": "トトノ", "text": "私の名前はトトノ。行商人です。", "face": "u316"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "詳しい話を聞かせてください。", "face": "lbbf1ee25fd02"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920057_3147", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 936, "y": 421}, {"k": "m", "x": 138, "y": 156, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 236, "y": 182, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 329, "y": 207, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 519, "y": 175, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 300, "y": 276, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 424, "y": 389, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 522, "y": 395, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 425, "y": 173, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 421, "y": 70, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 642, "y": 297, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 613, "y": 367, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 745, "y": 328, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 843, "y": 360, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 421, "y": 481, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 518, "y": 71, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 519, "y": 484, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 109, "y": 216, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 205, "y": 246, "id": 217}, {"k": "m", "x": 714, "y": 395, "id": 218}, {"k": "m", "x": 816, "y": 423, "id": 219}, {"k": "m", "x": 337, "y": 350, "id": 220}, {"k": "m", "x": 611, "y": 215, "id": 221}, {"k": "r", "x": 330, "y": 104, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 262, "y": 139, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 626, "y": 111, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 897, "y": 308, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 734, "y": 251, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 661, "y": 428, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 611, "y": 468, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 178, "y": 104, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 106, "y": 277, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 228, "y": 378, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 827, "y": 484, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 302, "y": 446, "id": 311}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "Holy Night Bow Cavalry", "description_en": "They suddenly assaulted the Prince, those in red clothing riding a reindeer….\n\nBeginner (★1 target: average Lv1, 5 enemies per sortie)"}